# layer-artifact-path-prescriptions reads the validator under test and the resolver it loads
# beside itself (fail-open: W11 when absent, so it is REQUIRED and sentinel-guarded in run.sh),
# plus what seed.sh copies into the seeded consumer: the layer contract, the artifact-path
# grammar and the sprint-status schema. lib/ is the sourced preamble. Its own directory is
# copied by the runner without being named.
!core/scripts/validate-layer-entries.sh
!core/scripts/artifact-path-config.sh
core/skills/ai-dlc/layer-contract.yaml
core/skills/ai-dlc/artifact-path-grammar.md
core/schemas/sprint-status.json
core/fixtures/lib/
